					Id.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέργειαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			; of a child, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Sacr.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἡμιτελὲς καταλείπειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.1.3
