				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ. περὶ λόγους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ. τὴν ἀρετήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.199
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
